sops.workflow:
1. User -> Transportation Planner;
2. Transportation Planner -> Accommodation Planner;
3. Accommodation Planner -> Restaurant Planner
   Accommodation Planner -> Attractions Planner (in parallel);
4. Restaurant Planner, Attractions Planner -> Final Plan Summarizer;
5. Final Plan Summarizer -> End.

Description:
First, the Transportation Planner determines the route between Greer, and two Pennsylvania cities, ensuring a closed-loop 5-day itinerary with explicit origin notation and validated transportation. This framework is passed to the Accommodation Planner to secure stays meeting PA-specific minimum-night requirements. Simultaneously, the Restaurant and Attractions Planners curate non-repeating, location-accurate options for meals and activities. The Final Plan Summarizer enforces mandatory validation of PA city count and origin formatting before consolidating all data into the final itinerary.
